{
 "_what": "Act VI's plates -- the Ghost welcome, Jorge Castro's six lines over the close-up, the Cayde-6 reveal, and the three gold credits that follow it. AUTHORED, not derived: every window below is an owner mark, converted from megacut time to act VI FILM time and then CONFIRMED ON AN EXTRACTED FRAME before a name was attached to it. Copy is reproduced verbatim from the owner.",
 "_narration_became_pills": "2026-08-15, owner: the narration is 'individual senteces spaced out over the course of the shot, one line per with castrojo talking'. The single stacked title card (`cayde_narration`, 397.111 + 4.5 s, all six lines at once) is RETIRED and replaced by six `kind: chat` pills, one line each, credited to his GitHub handle -- act IV's precedent, and his name has already been said by the reveal three cards earlier. Two lines changed with the same instruction: 'For fives years' -> 'For five years' (the owner corrected his own brief), and 'Lead the way, open source will follow' -> 'Lead the way, we will follow'. Both are OWNER-SUPPLIED, hence `copy_source: owner_supplied` rather than `brief`.",
 "_where_the_pills_sit": "Programme 21:19.5 maps to Act VI 353.657 (post-12f4ebb clock; was 21:39 / 373.127 before the interruption came out), Jorge Castro's face close-up. The six readable pills start there, one per bar at 3.157914 s, and hold 2.8 s each. The last clears at 372.247, leaving 1.794 s before the Cayde reveal at 374.041; no two cards share a window.",
 "_letterbox": "Act VI is 2.40:1 in a 1920x1080 frame -- cropdetect on the delivered act gives crop=1920:800:0:140. The pills carry `position: letterbox`, so they seat in the bottom matte (rendered top edge y=979, picture bottom y=940) and never cover picture. The reveal and the gold credits keep `position: left` on the picture, unchanged.",
 "_clock": "The brief's marks are MEGACUT time. Act VI film = megacut - 673.992 (tools/megacut.py --locate agrees: 17:37 -> VI @ 6:23.041). Nothing here is a film timecode the owner typed, and nothing here was converted twice.",
 "_why_here": "Act II plates Jorge Castro as `[ REDACTED ]` with the note 'act II only -- he is revealed later in the programme'. This is that reveal: the programme withholds his name for sixteen minutes and pays it off on Cayde-6 walking out of the fog.",
 "_film_sec": 423.993,
 "_shifted": "2026-08-13, issue #104: every `at` below moved +10.811 s ACT-FILM time. The interruption (19.470 s: 1.0 silent + 4.0 slide + 4.0 plate + the clip at 10.470) replaced the 8.659 s pause at bed 322.200, and every window here is after it, so the shots these plates are anchored to play 10.811 s later in the film. The windows themselves are unchanged; the frames they were verified against are the same frames, at the new offsets. Bed time is untouched -- the pause consumes no bed time. || 2026-08-20, 12f4ebb: the owner ordered the Amber interruption OUT of act VI ('get rid of it lol this moved to the endless song'). The 19.470 s block at wall 322.200-341.670 (1.0 silent + 4.0 slide + 4.0 plate + 10.470 clip) is gone, so every window after it moved -19.470 s act-film time onto the SAME shots and the same bars; the bed clock never advanced across the block, so the song is untouched. Film is 423.993 s now.",
